{"ld": 1529, "paper": "SP613", "session": "132", "title": "An Act to Enhance the Protection of High-value Natural Resources Statewide", "sponsor_id": "s-bennett-richard", "cosponsor_ids": ["s-brenner-stacy", "h-bridgeo-william", "h-bunker-stephan", "h-dill-james", "h-eder-john", "h-frost-sharon", "h-hepler-allison", "s-ingwersen-henry", "h-pluecker-william"], "committee_code": "ACF", "committee_name": "Agriculture, Conservation and Forestry", "summary": {"text": "This bill:\n\n1. Directs the Land for Maine's Future Board to give preferential consideration in land acquisition projects that conserve late-successional forests and old-growth forests; 2. Requires the Director of the Bureau of Forestry within the Department of Agriculture, Conservation and Forestry to include information regarding late-successional forests and old-growth forests in the director's report on state forests; 3. Requires the Maine Land Use Planning Commission to adopt rules to reclassify all lakes that are currently undeveloped but high value into other management classifications; and 4. Directs the Department of Agriculture, Conservation and Forestry to develop a comprehensive, statewide strategy to enhance the conservation of late-successional forests and old-growth forests.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0613&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "enacted", "status_label": "Enacted", "final_disposition": {"label": "Enacted", "date": "2025-07-01", "governor_action": "Signed", "governor_action_date": "2025-07-01"}, "fiscal_status": "Not Yet Determined", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 1529)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0613&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (S-271)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0613&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}, {"label": "Amendment S-A to C-A (S-478)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/ge